              "value": "Based on `{{$context.$nodes.PREPAREWIDGETSTODISPLAY.$output.result}}`, render content using this priority:\n\n1. If `multiRecordWidget` exists and has data, render `multiRecordWidget` first.\n2. If `multiRecordWidget` does not exist, render `noDemandCard`.\n3. Render `scrapCard` last, but only if it exists and has data.\n4. If none of the above widgets/cards contain data, show: `Currently there are no suggestions`.\n\nRules:\n\n* Treat a widget as existing only when it is present and not empty.\n* Do not render `noDemandCard` when `multiRecordWidget` is rendered.\n* Do not render `scrapCard` unless it exists.\n* Render at most one primary widget first, then `scrapCard` last.\n"
            }
